export const VOICE_FILES={"Adam: Hello? Dr. Noa? Why are you calling so early?": ["../assets/voices/en195-981b9ed5e44c0a66.mp3"], "Noa: Good morning, Adam. Today we are testing the spider silk in Chamber Eight. We want to develop strong ropes for rescue teams. I need you at the laboratory.": ["../assets/voices/en195-f69500070992ec91.mp3"], "Noa: Put on your work clothes, take your bag and ID badge, and drive over. The team is getting ready. Stay away from the chamber until we check that the glass is locked. See you soon.": ["../assets/voices/en195-4e8d94182d63eaae.mp3"], "Good morning! This is your home. You work as a research assistant at the spider laboratory. Today, the team will test strong silk for rescue ropes. Go to the wardrobe on your right and get ready for work.": ["../assets/voices/en195-96fd6ed2151fa07a.mp3"], "Work clothes on. Now take your bag and employee badge.": ["../assets/voices/en195-573269d7898d9af0.mp3"], "Your bag contains a flashlight and employee badge. The laboratory is in an old estate outside town. A message reads: “Meet us at Chamber 08.” When you are ready, go to the door between the windows and press E.": ["../assets/voices/en195-28852e698bcffa38.mp3"], "On the Way to the Research Estate…": ["../assets/voices/en195-824f2b8688d7c0e7.mp3"], "Robot: Good morning! Welcome to the research estate. Dr. Noa is waiting on your left.": ["../assets/voices/en195-efca7961e6157d7f.mp3"], "Noa: We're developing spider silk for rescue ropes. Amir will explain how we measure its strength.": ["../assets/voices/en195-4ac9bf79f614ff45.mp3"], "Amir: This thread can hold an enormous weight. But the spider has grown since yesterday. Maya wants another check.": ["../assets/voices/en195-86d14b77e968eeba.mp3"], "Maya: One short test. If its size changes, stop immediately. Yoav has prepared the computer on your right.": ["../assets/voices/en195-3d74fe7b004254ab.mp3"], "Yoav: The sensors are ready. Go to the button beside the chamber and start the silk test.": ["../assets/voices/en195-2cb1e56106a6e789.mp3"], "Maya: Wait… The reading is rising too fast. Stop the feed!": ["../assets/voices/en195-cda072fc3dcedf76.mp3"], "PA: Laboratory emergency. All personnel, evacuate immediately through the emergency exit!": ["../assets/voices/en195-1dce258399921f6a.mp3"], "Yoav: The door is closing! Wait! He's still inside!": ["../assets/voices/en195-290ee3b55875dbce.mp3"], "Memory system online. Thank you for connecting the battery. I am Maintenance Unit 08. I built the rails, repaired the doors, and remembered what the researchers preferred to forget.": ["../assets/voices/en195-9175642a8929bcc3.mp3"], "We wanted to help people. Spider silk is light and strong. The researchers dreamed of thin rescue ropes that could lift heavy loads out of collapsed buildings.": ["../assets/voices/en195-9e8c166cdd8998ad.mp3"], "At the start of Experiment 08, the spider was tiny. We measured how much silk it spun and tested every thread. Everything seemed normal for weeks. Then a sample arrived from the research station beneath the house.": ["../assets/voices/en195-fe037eb593feba7e.mp3"], "The sample changed the silk. The threads grew thicker, but the spider began to grow. I asked them to stop. The old computer rejected the shutdown command, and feeding continued all night.": ["../assets/voices/en195-6036f3be1932d569.mp3"], "It learned our movements. While the researchers watched the floor, it climbed to the ceiling. The first crack appeared in the glass. Then we heard three taps from inside.": ["../assets/voices/en195-a2a8a28261e48c84.mp3"], "The glass shattered. I locked the doors to stop it, but it crawled through the maintenance vent above them. That is why I tell you to check the ceiling, too.": ["../assets/voices/en195-f85a6eae66f3194f.mp3"], "The police and rescue teams arrived in the morning. They followed webs down to the basement. The last camera showed an empty corridor, but its microphone kept recording eight legs getting closer.": ["../assets/voices/en195-4190d6d3db792b96.mp3"], "I guided some researchers to the exit. Others stayed in the lower station. Nobody has answered my calls since. I saved the records on the computer beside the secret journal.": ["../assets/voices/en195-63e7b2b40490756a.mp3"], "We split the elevator code across three notes: one in the bedroom, one in the dining room, and one in the playroom. Put them in your bag and read the lines in order.": ["../assets/voices/en195-23f23aa9ab70f9d6.mp3"], "The elevator has buttons for Floors 1 and 2, plus a question mark. That one needs an access card. We left it in the upstairs laboratory. Beneath the house is the source of the experiment. Look carefully before approaching the shaft.": ["../assets/voices/en195-7972ff5db3270ebb.mp3"], "To escape, use the flashlight you already have and find an axe. Break the boards across the front door. The spider does not always know where you are. Turn a corner, move away quietly, and hide before it sees you.": ["../assets/voices/en195-5be3f923f56dc19a.mp3"], "My battery is fading again. I'll sit here and guard the archive. The red button opens the door. If you hear three taps… do not answer.": ["../assets/voices/en195-af9da5636b0c3f8a.mp3"], "Where am I? Where is everyone?": ["../assets/voices/en195-ede273700a32d430.mp3"], "News Anchor: This morning at the research estate, scientists are preparing Experiment 08 to test spider silk.": ["../assets/voices/en195-83f4717093f0b415.mp3"], "News Anchor: The team is developing strong, lightweight rescue ropes to save people trapped in dangerous places.": ["../assets/voices/en195-674a6b2ebd92a50a.mp3"], "News Anchor: Researchers say all testing will take place inside a sealed glass chamber. More updates later today.": ["../assets/voices/en195-fbb5a3af8122ca34.mp3"], "Adam: I want to see what's on the news.": ["../assets/voices/en195-624205483a12bdb1.mp3"], "Adam: No… Where are you taking me?": ["../assets/voices/en195-a25f3023ff1419c9.mp3"], "Adam: The house… I can't stay awake…": ["../assets/voices/en195-1eaad12fa9b7fdd7.mp3"], "Adam: I'm recording…": ["../assets/voices/en195-3f0c34da8323d8ff.mp3"], "Adam: It grabbed the spider's legs!": ["../assets/voices/en195-5ea617cfdca419e4.mp3"], "Robot: Run to the car! I'll hold it off!": ["../assets/voices/en195-bbeee2a0b0f4bdbc.mp3"], "Adam: What will happen to the robot? I need some sleep.": ["../assets/voices/en195-1274de8f90dd63ec.mp3"], "News: Extraordinary footage has arrived from the research estate.": ["../assets/voices/en195-0f7a2485cc134d0b.mp3"], "News: A robot held off the spider, allowing a researcher to escape.": ["../assets/voices/en195-8e6ad87ab5066981.mp3"], "News: The robot's fate remains unknown…": ["../assets/voices/en195-675bcfc0f5ff0784.mp3"], "Adam: All right. I'm going to save the robot.": ["../assets/voices/en195-0aa786a3743bdedb.mp3"], "Adam: Back at the spider's house. I have to find the robot.": ["../assets/voices/en195-a86c3340c4fb3e0d.mp3"], "Adam: There you are. Hold on. I'll help you.": ["../assets/voices/en195-7c7e5e036f91497c.mp3"], "Robot: Adam… You came back for me. I'm still here.": ["../assets/voices/en195-0c3c38b691500f5e.mp3"], "Robot: The key is in my pocket. There's an emergency battery in the basement electrical cabinet. Don't leave me here.": ["../assets/voices/en195-31da812eaf5f12f6.mp3"], "Adam: I found the battery. I'm coming back.": ["../assets/voices/en195-d5709aa3580efb76.mp3"], "Robot: My leg is damaged. I can't run.": ["../assets/voices/en195-5fb75130f3de931e.mp3"], "Adam: Then we'll go slowly. I'm not leaving you.": ["../assets/voices/en195-e9742b3d9437c04a.mp3"], "Robot: This time, you saved me. Thank you, Adam.": ["../assets/voices/en195-9fabd2860a868c87.mp3"], "Adam: Aah!": ["../assets/voices/en195-767097b33b1b7e67.mp3"], "Adam: It must have been a dream… I still have the battery.": ["../assets/voices/en195-1dff519fae5f582c.mp3"], "Robot: I can walk. Follow me. I'll lead you to the door.": ["../assets/voices/en195-3bf5be92ea85baa0.mp3"], "Adam: The door is open! Run to my car!": ["../assets/voices/en195-5144cc8383107e36.mp3"], "Adam: We're going home. Both of us this time.": ["../assets/voices/en195-ede2f23e0964f7e9.mp3"], "Robot: We're home. Thank you for coming back for me, Adam.": ["../assets/voices/en195-0c1093f0aa23c275.mp3"], "Adam: I need to watch the news.": ["../assets/voices/en195-3a283fd455e40141.mp3"], "Adam: I'll fix your leg. Wait here. I'll get the tools.": ["../assets/voices/en195-29b86998a1c2fe63.mp3"], "Adam: Robot? Where are you?": ["../assets/voices/en195-d6f047641a5ba773.mp3"], "Robot: Out here. I found something on your car.": ["../assets/voices/en195-5b821384407a3110.mp3"], "Adam: Wait… What is that on the car door?": ["../assets/voices/en195-0d32fc50cf69b689.mp3"], "Robot: This silk is fresh. Adam, close the door.": ["../assets/voices/en195-f742d603297eabec.mp3"], "Adam: The whole street went dark. Someone across the road is signaling to us.": ["../assets/voices/en195-d1601b606e01c3b3.mp3"], "Adam: The TV is showing my house. It's a security camera!": ["../assets/voices/en195-9f87b70f7f3b6eb1.mp3"], "Robot: Look at the roof. It was behind us all along.": ["../assets/voices/en195-13d2f5a3e451c205.mp3"], "Robot: It followed us. We must find the neighbor and get out.": ["../assets/voices/en195-193daede885765af.mp3"], "Adam: Let's go home. We'll lock the door.": ["../assets/voices/en195-9151586afbd528cb.mp3"], "Adam: I'll check the car through the window.": ["../assets/voices/en195-044e30089c6a7a66.mp3"], "Robot: Adam! What happened?": ["../assets/voices/en195-b243550a3e55b7c6.mp3"], "Adam: I saw the spider! It's here, at the window!": ["../assets/voices/en195-5fc3a429f8e5e63e.mp3"], "Adam: Did you hear that noise?": ["../assets/voices/en195-39371cfaf5cb9455.mp3"], "Robot: No. I didn't hear anything.": ["../assets/voices/en195-3be4869b20888be1.mp3"]};
